[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468740919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99081#issuecomment-2468740919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99081","id":2468740919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TJf83","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T17:57:34Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T17:57:34Z","body":"I think your original notes are still correct. If you're bothering to add a comment with the expected output, it should match the actual output.\r\n\r\nI'm also not sure this decreases readability. In some other contexts (like shaders), adding the explicit `.0` to whole number floats is favored, because it makes it clear you're working with a float-based type rather than an int-based type. In this case, I could take it or leave it, but it's not *clearly* a decrease in readability.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468740919/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468762183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99081#issuecomment-2468762183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99081","id":2468762183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TJlJH","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T18:09:50Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T18:16:14Z","body":"I have to say it _somewhat_ impacts readability when multiple Vector types are involved (see the PR itself). This readability issue is [somewhat similar to what this user brought up](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/47502#issuecomment-2451679290).\r\nKeep in mind there can be a lot of numbers, dots, and commas packed within these codeblocks, oftentimes in the same line. Also, these numbers within comments have no syntax highlighting.\r\n\r\nProblematic examples include:\r\n- ```gdscript\r\n  print(polygon) # Prints [(50.0, 50.0), (150.0, 50.0), (150.0, 150.0), (50.0, 150.0)]\r\n- ```gdscript\r\n  print(my_basis.x) # Prints (2.0, 0.0, 0.0).\r\n  print(my_basis.y) # Prints (0.0, 4.0, 0.0).\r\n  print(my_basis.z) # Prints (0.0, 0.0, 8.0).\r\n- ```gdscript\r\n  var a = AABB(Vector3(4, 4, 4), Vector3(8, 8, 8)).grow(4)\r\n  print(a.position) # Prints (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\r\n  print(a.size)     # Prints (16.0, 16.0, 16.0)\r\n\r\n  var b = AABB(Vector3(0, 0, 0), Vector3(8, 4, 2)).grow(2)\r\n  print(b.position) # Prints (-2.0, -2.0, -2.0)\r\n  print(b.size)     # Prints (12.0, 8.0, 6.0)\r\n\r\nNote that one solution could also be to rework the examples to mitigate this issue, outright.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468762183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468789882","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99081#issuecomment-2468789882","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99081","id":2468789882,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TJr56","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T18:26:48Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T18:26:48Z","body":"Of the examples in your last comment, only the polygon example seems unreadable to me, since it's a long line. In the other examples, a single vector print on each line seems fine. But then again I've been mostly working with shader examples where floats *always* use `.0` for clarity.\r\n\r\nIn general, I think accuracy should be prioritized, since these comments are presumably used to *check your work* when you copy-paste an example. Some readability loss is acceptable for that, IMO.\r\n\r\nI don't feel all that strongly about this, though. Making an exception for vectors, or just overall not caring about matching the exact output, is also a reasonable choice. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468789882/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469205213","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99081#issuecomment-2469205213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99081","id":2469205213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TLRTd","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription